From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thehobbit85 <thehobbit85@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:57:22 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Three Houses: match the registered shader map to the current
 split

The 29 GLSLC shaders first appear in DATA1.bin entry 2391. Backport the refreshed tables from upstream e0dc79c9 so the registered 1.2.0 build passes its existing check. The shader keys, package indices and translation facts are unchanged.

Upstream-Status: backport e0dc79c9bacda37bc078f13d9f2a306f583e62f5
Reason: The pin rejects 29 valid rows while packing Fire Emblem: Three Houses 1.2.0 (v327680).
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#788

---
 dm/games/010055D009F78000/shader_facts.tsv |  2 +-
 dm/games/010055D009F78000/shader_map.tsv   | 60 +++++++++++-----------
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dm/games/010055D009F78000/shader_facts.tsv b/dm/games/010055D009F78000/shader_facts.tsv
index 87c0f90..c4f2943 100644
--- a/dm/games/010055D009F78000/shader_facts.tsv
+++ b/dm/games/010055D009F78000/shader_facts.tsv
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
